  "details": "As a user I would like the ability to block groups so that they don't appear on my social menu once they have been blocked.  Users that have been banned from groups or users that have left groups are constantly reminded of these groups on their social menu.  Providing users a way of blocking these groups from being shown on their social menu would improve their ability to move on.  This would also allow users to block groups that they have objections to such as NSFW related groups.",
